# UI Potion Cursor Rules

Read and follow @AGENTS.md.

This file is intentionally small. Cursor supports `AGENTS.md` as plain Markdown project instructions, while `.cursorrules` is a legacy compatibility file. Keep shared project guidance in `AGENTS.md` and keep only Cursor-specific overrides here.

If your Cursor version does not expand @AGENTS.md, open the root `AGENTS.md` file before editing this repository.
